# error: 11:23: write `@align(P)`: Rig's builtin is `@align`; Zig's `@alignOf` works only inside `raw`
# error: 11:36: write `@name(Int)`: Rig's builtin is `@name`; Zig's `@typeName` works only inside `raw`
# error: 12:15: write `@type(x)`: Rig's builtin is `@type`; Zig's `@TypeOf` works only inside `raw`
